    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoshea ntemi wa Isilaeli wa kūmalīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi na ībīlī aho Ahazi alī ntemi wa Yuda, Hoshea ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ela ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka kenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe akīīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; gwike ītī gīt'ūmo baalī bīītīla a batemi ba Isilaeli abo baalī batongi bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu shikū jenījo ntemi Shalimanesa wa Ashulu wiza kūndumīla ū Hoshea; nguno ū Hoshea walī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo ng'wa Shalimanesa, na watobaga goodi būlī ng'waka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo kwimanīla ū ntemi wa Ashulu wabona gīkī ū Hoshea wagalūkile; nguno akatūma banhū kūja kūlī ntemi So wa Misili, na goodi watwalaga būlī ng'waka ū kūlī ntemi wa Ashulu, nī yene ooya ū kūng'winha, ūmo wītīlaga nakale. Na lūūlū ū Shalimanesa ūndima ū Hoshea ūmponya mu jeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi wa Ashulu wīdumīla ī sī ya Isilaeli pyī ī yose; ū nzengo gwa Samalia ūgūpīndīlīja ikanza lya myaka idatū na mabità ga bashilikale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa kenda go ng'wa Hoshea aho alī ntemi, ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūgūdima ū nzengo gwa Samalia, ūbasaamīja Ashulu a Baisilaeli, ūūkabatūūla Hala na Gozani bbihī na mongo gwa Haboli, bangī mu mizengo ya kū sī ya Bamede.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isilaeli kūsaamiwa nguno ya būhūbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yose yenīyī īkabilongela a Baisilaeli kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wabo kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wabo, ūyo walī wabafunya mu sī ya Misili, ūbīnja ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo ng'wa Falao ū ntemi wa Misili; bandya kūlamya bamulungu bangī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kūlondeela nhūngwa ja mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagapeeja gīkī gabīngīle, na kūshimīzīla mu shīmīle īsho batemi ba Isilaeli bakashingīja ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būyūbeeja mu mbisīla mihayo yabūbi īyo yalī ītanyejaga ū SEEBA Mulungu wabo. Bizengela mapandī ga higūlya hose hose ū mu mizengo yabo, ībize īpīndīlījiwe ndugu nūūlū yaya; pye a hose, nose būyūzenga na kwigūlya ya numba ndīhu ja balang'hani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būtūūla mawe ga kūlamiwa, na ng'hīngī ja Maashela hose pye ū kwigūlya ya ngūlū, nū mu mbeho ja mitī ya madūūtū manīlīzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūzuukīja būbbani būlī heene a h'ipandī lya higūlya, gīt'ūmo gīītīlaga a mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagapeeja gabīngīle a boi. Ī mihayo īyo bīītaga yalī yabūbi no, ya kūmpelanya ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūlamya shiikolile nūūlū īkī ū SEEBA walī wabawīla, “A bing'we yaya ū kwīta ī yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wabahūgūlaga būlī makanza a Baisilaeli na a banhū ba Yuda mu nzīla ya bahangi bakwe na baboni abo wabatūmīlaga; wabawīlaga, “Galūkagi mujileke ī nzīla jiing'we ī jabūbi; shimīzīlagi mu kahelele na malange gane, kūlenganīla nī shilagīlo ī shose īsho naabalagīla bakūlūgenji bing'we kūshidima, nī mihayo īyo nang'wenhela mu nzīla ya batūmami bane a bahangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo batazunije ū kwigwa; nīyo baalī na mitwe midiimu gīt'ūmo baalī a bakūlūgenji babo, abo baalī batansanije ū SEEBA Mulungu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būgalema a malange gakwe, nī lilagane īlo walī walagana na bakūlūgenji babo, pyī nū ū būhūgūji ūbo walī wabinha. Būbiza balondeeji ba shiikolile īsho shilī shikolo shitī na ngofyoolo, nabo būbiza batī na ngofyoolo. Būyūlondeela nhūngwa ja mahanga ayo gaalī gabapīndīlīgije, nūūlū īkī ū SEEBA walī wabakomeleja ūbawīla, “Yaya a bing'we ū kwīta ūmo bakīītīlaga a benabo.” Īyo walī wabalemeja ū SEEBA kwīyīta hū būbiza bīīti bayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshīība pye gete ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wabo, bibeegeja shiikolile shibīlī sha kūsula, sha kūbiza gītī ndama; na ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela. Būyūgiinamīla mabità ga sonda ja ng'wigūlū, na lī Baalī būyūlīlamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha būyūbapemba mu moto na baana babo bagosha na bakīma, kūlwa kūbafunya shitambò. Būbiza bīīti ba mihayo ya būlogi, na kūshimīzīla mu nhūngwa ja būchūja; bijinja boi benekīlī mu kwīta mihayo yabūbi ū miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; būnsaayīcha no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa yose yenīyo ū SEEBA ūbapelanīla no a Baisilaeli, kūshisha ūbaponya bīnga ū kū būtongi bokwe. Lūlekeelwa lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo na a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda batashidiimile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wabo. Nabo būyūshimīzīla ū mu shītīle īsho Baisilaeli bakashingīja ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūbalema a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Isilaeli a bose; ūbalūhya na kūbatūūla mu makono ga biboneeji, būyūbasoja ī shikolo; kūshisha lyūshika ikanza lya kūbaponya gete na kwīnga ū kū būtongi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA aho wabalekanya a Baisilaeli, ūbīnja ū mu numba ya ng'wa Daūdi, būntūūla Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati kūbiza ntemi wabo. Ū Yeloboamu ūbahūmbūla a Baisilaeli, ūbīnja ū mu nzīla ya kūnondeela SEEBA; ūbenheleja kūgwa mu būhūbi būtaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būdimana nabo ū būhūbi ūbo akabalanga kwīta ū Yeloboamu; batagalūkile gīkī babūleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū SEEBA ūbīnja ū kū būtongi bokwe, gīt'ūmo walī wabahūgūlīla mu nzīla ya batūmami bakwe a bahangi a bose. Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli būbiza bīnjiwa ū mu sī yabo būsaamījiwa Ashulu, h'ūko balī nī lelo yīnīyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samalia kwenhelwa banhū bangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Ashulu wenha banhū bangī kūfuma sī ja Kusa, Ava, Hamasi, Shefavaimu; wiza ūbatūūla ū mu mizengo ya Samalia a ha ng'wanya gwa Baisilaeli. Bīdima ī Samalia yūbiza yabo, būzenga ū mu mizengo yamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balandya ū kwikala moi, baalī batī na logohano ū kūlī SEEBA, na lūūlū ūbatūmīla shimba jūyūbabūlaga bamò babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūwīlwa, “A banhū abo wabasaamije ūbatwala kū mizengo ya Samalia batagamanile a majīle ga ng'wa mulungu wa sī yenīyo. Na lūūlū wabatūmīlile shimba jilīyūbabūlaga, nguno batagamanile gete a majīle gakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūlagīja ūhaya, “Twalagi koi ūmò wa bagabīji abo ng'wabasaamije kūfuma ī Samalia, aje akikale kwenūko, ayūbalanga a banhū a majīle ga ng'wa mulungu wa kwenūko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ūmò wa bagabīji abo baalī bading'wa būsaamiwa kūfuma ī Samalia, wiza kwikala Beeseli; ūbalanga ī mbika ya koolecha logohano ū kūlī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnamya SEEBA hamò na shiikolile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene būl'ihanga lya banhū ū kū mizengo īyo baalī batūūlwa kwikala, baalī bibeegeja bamulungu; a bamulungu benabo būbatūūla ū mu maduku ayo baalī bagabeeja a Baisilseli ū mu mapandī ga higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Babuloni būbeeja mulungu wabo Sukoti-benoti, a bana Kuti būbeeja Neliga, a banhū ba Hamasi būbeeja Ashima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Ava būbeeja Nibuhazi na Talitaki, a bana Shefavaimu būyūbapemba mu moto a baana babo balībafunīja shitambò bamulungu babo ba Adulameleki na Anameleki, a bamulungu ba mu sī ya Shefavaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A hene banamyaga ū SEEBA, alīyo hangī bisolelaga na banhū ba būlī mbika kūlwa kūbeeja myanya ya būgabīji ū mu maduku ayo gaalī kū mapandī ga higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA banamyaga, alīyo na a bamulungu babo babalamyaga kūlenganīla nī shīmīle sha kū mahanga ga kūko baalī bīnjiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha nī lelo īyī bataalī bashidaamīīlile ī shītīle shabo ī sha kale. Balemile ū kūnamya ū SEEBA, nūūlū ū kūdimana na a malange gakwe na a katongeelele kakwe, pyī nī shilagīlo shakwe na a kahelele ako walī wabinha a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Yakobo, ūyo akang'winha lina lya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA aho alībeeja ilagane nabo a Baisilaeli walī wabakomeleja ūbawīla, “A bing'we yaya ū kūlamya bamulungu bangī, nūūlū kwinama kū būtongi wabo, yaya kūbatūmamīla, nūūlū kūbafunīja shitambò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA ūyo akagoloola nkono ūng'wīnja mu sī ya Misili na būdūla būtaale, ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo shiigelelile munamye na kūntūmamīla, nū kūmfunīja ī shitambò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi gete, būlī makanza mushimīzīle ū mihayo īyo wang'wandīkīla, ū mu malange gakwe na a katongeelele kakwe, nī shilagīlo shakwe, na a kahelele kakwe. Yaya ū kūlamya bamulungu bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizūlyība ī lilagane īlo nabeegije ning'hwe, mutizūgema kūlamya bamulungu bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we shing'wigelelile kūnamya SEEBA Mulungu wing'we dūhū; ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene akūmupīja ū mu makono ga banishi bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo naheene batigwiile nūūlū hado, bakikala mo dūhū ū mu nhūngwa jabo ja shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū benaba nūūlū īkī banamyaga ū SEEBA, alīyo nī shiikolile shabo bashilamyaga. Kūshisha lelo īy'a baana babo na a bizūkūlū babo bataalī bakwītaga gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga a bakūlūgenji babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
